               re theo trang thai dang nhap — offcanvas cua _Layout khong can vi
               chi song tren cac trang [Authorize]. Khach vang lai dang nhap tu
               2 nut o trang co so (/DangKyOnline/{slug}), khong phai tu day. *@
            @if (laAdmin)
            {
